{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中，Margaret傅季馨向大家示範製作惹味十足的「催淚辣椒皮蛋醬拌麵」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">催淚辣椒皮蛋醬拌麵｜材料</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">催淚辣椒皮蛋醬拌麵｜做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6e7e45a1-f9bb-43ba-a74d-f83eea87691e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026r3kjTZa2bI1788515298.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6e7e45a1-f9bb-43ba-a74d-f83eea87691e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T09:59:56.045090+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}